Verbatim copy of the generic CAPI-ready image recipe of the Elemental 3 parity project
(lab/generic-image: build.sh, inspect.sh, defaults.env, deviations.json, lib/, targets/),
as of 2026-11-17. Do not edit these files here; change the recipe at its source and run
"make sync-recipe RECIPE_SRC=<path to lab/generic-image>".

This is lab tooling, not released tooling: defaults.env points at a fork branch of
SUSE/elemental and deviations.json lists every difference from a released elemental3.
